$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Prakis Prime" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 2/5" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> A new intergalactic zoo is under construction here and set to open in approximately two years.  Even though it hasn't opened yet, the zoo has gained intergalactic fame and most expect the zoo to be a great success.  Investors have flocked to the project, and the influx of money has caused the original plan to double in size and scope!  Now there is room for only one more investor, but two extremely wealthy investors are dead set on getting in on the project...and they are willing to kill to do so!  And what better time to assassinate the rival investor than when he is unprotected, touring the zoo's force pens.\n\nProtect your Investor while assassinating the enemy's Investor.  The first team to kill the other team's Investor shall be declared the victor!\n\nThanks to -iA- TripLikeIDo for creating the Forcefield Globe";
